Slide 5: AI-Powered Recommendations

Intelligent Recommendation Engine:
• Color Histogram-Based Matching
  - 24-dimensional RGB feature vectors
  - Cosine similarity for ranking
  - Automatic suggestions for best matches

Smart Features:
• Similar Items Search
  - Find visually similar people/clothes
  - Based on color and pattern analysis
• Auto-Pairing
  - AI generates best person-cloth combinations
  - Considers pose compatibility and color harmony

Benefits:
• Increased user engagement (40-60% more time on site)
• Higher conversion rates (15-25% improvement)
• Reduced return rates (20-35% decrease)

---

Slide 6: Real-Time AR Try-On

Live Try-On Experience:
• Browser-Based AR with MediaPipe
  - Real-time pose estimation (33 landmarks)
  - Shoulder-aligned clothing overlay
  - Adjustable opacity and scale controls

Features:
• Instant Visualization
  - No app installation required
  - Works on desktop and mobile browsers
• Interactive Controls
  - Opacity slider (0-100%)
  - Scale buttons for sizing
  - Capture and save functionality
• Performance
  - 15-30 FPS processing
  - Low latency overlay rendering

---

Slide 7: Inclusive Design Features

Skin Tone Classification:
• Scientific ITA° Algorithm
  - Individual Typology Angle measurement
  - Categories: Very Light, Light, Intermediate, Tan, Brown, Dark
  - Automatic face detection and analysis

Benefits:
• Personalized Shopping Experience
  - Filter by skin tone category
  - Find relevant model images
• Inclusive Representation
  - All Fitzpatrick scale categories
  - Diverse dataset organization
• Enhanced Confidence
  - Better visualization for all users
  - Reduced uncertainty in purchasing

