Slide 8: Technical Implementation

System Components:
• Deep Learning Backend
  - PyTorch neural networks
  - Pre-trained VITON-HD models
  - Segmentation, GMM, and ALIAS generators
• Web Application Layer
  - Flask REST API backend
  - Responsive HTML/CSS/JavaScript frontend
  - Real-time AR processing
• Dataset Management
  - Automated preprocessing workflows
  - Clothing addition tools
  - Background removal utilities

Requirements:
• Hardware: CPU or GPU (NVIDIA GTX 1060+ recommended)
• Software: Python 3.8+, PyTorch, Flask, MediaPipe
• Storage: 20GB+ for models and datasets

---

Slide 9: Performance & Results

Quality Metrics:
• SSIM: 0.888 (structural similarity)
• PSNR: 21.38 dB (peak signal-to-noise ratio)
• LPIPS: 0.091 (learned perceptual similarity)
• FID: 11.03 (Fréchet inception distance)

Performance:
• GPU Inference: 1.05 seconds per image
• CPU Inference: 18.42 seconds per image
• AR Try-On: 15-30 FPS real-time processing
• User Experience: SUS score of 82.5 (excellent)

AI Recommendations:
• 78% of suggestions rated 4+ stars
• 88% skin tone classification accuracy
• 94% task success rate in user studies

